{
  "source": "Prompts/opener-navigate-2.mp4",
  "duration": 147.516375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.9,
      "text": "You now know how to use AI, and because you understand the engine underneath,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.56,
      "end": 7.48,
      "text": "its strange behavior actually makes sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.3,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "Your primary goal was to be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.1,
      "end": 11.4,
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.14,
      "end": 15.32,
      "text": "But now comes the question almost everyone is arguing about."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.96,
      "end": 19.98,
      "text": "Now that we control the tool, where does this entire technological shift"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 21.84,
      "text": "actually land for society?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.46,
      "end": 24.34,
      "text": "You have probably heard the voices already."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.96,
      "end": 27.14,
      "text": "People are deeply divided on what happens next."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.72,
      "end": 31.72,
      "text": "You likely know an AI optimist who thinks this technology is amazing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.14,
      "end": 35.06,
      "text": "fantastic, and every other superlative they can string together."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.8,
      "end": 39.84,
      "text": "You also know an AI warrior who is absolutely certain it will hurt society."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.9,
      "end": 41.7,
      "text": "Here's the honest part."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.38,
      "end": 42.92,
      "text": "Nobody knows."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.6,
      "end": 48.82,
      "text": "Not the optimists, not the warriors, not us, and not even the engineers actively"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.82,
      "end": 49.64,
      "text": "building the AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.74,
      "end": 51.82,
      "text": "Think back to history class."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.44,
      "end": 55.3,
      "text": "Centuries ago, map makers had to deal with a similar problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.3,
      "end": 59.9,
      "text": "They sometimes filled waters they did not understand with sea monsters and"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.9,
      "end": 60.74,
      "text": "strange serpents."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.52,
      "end": 64.68,
      "text": "The future of AI is like the unknown ocean on those old maps."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.72,
      "end": 68.92,
      "text": "The AI warriors filled these uncharted spaces with AI monsters"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.92,
      "end": 71.92,
      "text": "that destroy jobs, hack systems, and take over."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.48,
      "end": 76.02,
      "text": "AI optimists look at the exact sampling space and see easy,"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.02,
      "end": 77.72,
      "text": "clear sailing through open water."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.48,
      "end": 81.3,
      "text": "But those historical sailors didn't actually find sea monsters"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.78,
      "end": 84.1,
      "text": "and they rarely found easy, clear sailing either."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.1,
      "end": 87.16,
      "text": "They usually found something entirely unexpected."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.54,
      "end": 91.96,
      "text": "As we move forward, we have to take both views of the map seriously."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 96.12,
      "text": "The potential for monsters and the promise of open water."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.08,
      "end": 99.16,
      "text": "Only one thing is certain in all of this."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.84,
      "end": 101.2,
      "text": "AI is here to stay."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.02,
      "end": 103.9,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it keeps getting better endlessly."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.68,
      "end": 106.1,
      "text": "It just means it isn't going away."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.8,
      "end": 111.26,
      "text": "Since it is a permanent fixture, our best approach is to ask the right questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.26,
      "end": 112.76,
      "text": "before we map the territory."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.38,
      "end": 117.64,
      "text": "This section provides a tool set designed to help you answer three critical questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.8,
      "end": 122.1,
      "text": "First, why do people disagree so much about AI's future?"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.1,
      "end": 127.38,
      "text": "Second, what could AI do to make society better and where could it go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.24,
      "end": 131.54,
      "text": "And third, how could AI change my future life and work?"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.3,
      "end": 135.16,
      "text": "Right now, these questions are completely unanswered."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.88,
      "end": 138.78,
      "text": "They are the only compass we have before stepping into the unknown."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.56,
      "end": 141.18,
      "text": "Nobody has a map of what's coming."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.18,
      "end": 143.84,
      "text": "You're ready to sail into the blank space."
    }
  ],
